  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Innovate Moldova Phase II - Strengthening Moldova&#x2019;s Cyber Resilience, Key Industries and Inclusive Workforce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovate Moldova Phase II strengthens Moldova&#x2019;s national and societal resilience at a time of sustained cyber and hybrid pressure.
The project addresses three interlocking problems: public institutions, services and citizens exposed to cyber threats; key industries that underpin Moldova&#x2019;s resilience but lack operational and cyber capacity; and skills gaps, youth inactivity and gender disparities. It responds through three pillars: (1) cyber resilience of public services, institutions, businesses and people; (2) support to cyber and resilience-critical industries (ICT, tech, digital media, engineering); and (3) inclusion, skills and women&#x2019;s empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
